# API Changelog 1.0.0 vs. 1.0.0


## API Changes

### POST /pets
- :warning: removed the request property `oneOf[#/components/schemas/Cat]/petType`
- :warning: removed the request property `oneOf[#/components/schemas/Dog]/breed/oneOf[#/components/schemas/Breed1]/name`
- :warning: removed the request property `oneOf[#/components/schemas/Dog]/breed/oneOf[#/components/schemas/Breed2]/name`
- :warning: removed the request property `oneOf[#/components/schemas/Dog]/petType`
-  added the new optional request property `oneOf[#/components/schemas/Cat]/petType2`
-  added the new optional request property `oneOf[#/components/schemas/Dog]/breed/oneOf[#/components/schemas/Breed1]/name2`
-  added the new optional request property `oneOf[#/components/schemas/Dog]/breed/oneOf[#/components/schemas/Breed2]/name2`
-  added the new optional request property `oneOf[#/components/schemas/Dog]/petType2`
-  request discriminator property name changed from `petType` to `petType2`
-  request discriminator property name changed for `oneOf[#/components/schemas/Dog]/breed` request property from `name` to `name2`






